UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54604593443197
DESCRIPTION:In this session\, UC Davis librarians will demonstrate how to 
 find and appraise existing datasets\, share use cases where existing datas
 ets have had a lasting impact on health research\, and offer ways for part
 icipants to continue learning about data sharing through library data serv
 ices and asynchronous education.\n\nLearn more and register.\n\nThis event
  is part of the Digital Health and Informatics at UC Davis: Advancing Rese
 arch and Real-World Practice seminar series co-sponsored by the Center for
  Healthcare Policy and Research and the Clinical and Translational Science
  Center.
