SUMMARY:Human Rights Day
DESCRIPTION:Human Rights Day commemorates the adoption of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights and affirms that everyone deserves dignity\, freedom\, equality\, and protection from discrimination. It is an opportunity to reflect on our shared responsibility to challenge injustice\, stand against hate\, and help create communities where every person can belong. \nLearn more at the United Nations.
